{"id": "34175", "title": "狂情恋美人(江南情花5)", "author": "爱琤", "category": "文学名著", "count": 51, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34175.htm", "intro": "像她这种害人无数的妖孽死不足惜，偏偏自杀不成反而还遇上了不该遇的人。在他超乎寻常的关爱和无尽的呵护下，想不开的悲观念头逐渐转为对未来抱持期望，即使跟随他到天涯海角她亦义无反顾，相信只要和他在一起就一定能幸福到永远！ \r\n　　可惜爱上她的人终究倒楣注定替她担罪，尤其他爱到深处就算下地狱也无怨悔，她不要他违抗圣旨招来祸及全家的滔天大罪，也不让他为了拯救病入膏肓的自己牺牲生命。不得已“移情别恋”彻底伤害他执着的心，就让曾有的快乐回忆留存心中直到她死去……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34175", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2172283.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2172284.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2172285.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2172286.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2172287.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2172288.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2172289.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2172290.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2172291.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2172292.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2172293.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2172294.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2172295.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2172296.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2172297.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2172298.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2172299.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2172300.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2172301.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2172302.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2172303.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2172304.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2172305.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2172306.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file"